0d25fb3f636\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:99fa91fb-20db-42fc-8fa1-70d25fb3f636\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Found on the lab level of the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watch_Foundry\" title=\"Steel Watch Foundry\">Steel Watch Foundry</a>. <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1983&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;432</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Effective next tenday, all Banites will be on rotating shifts to guard the submersible - beginning with <a href=\"/wiki/Gasper_Throaks\" title=\"Gasper Throaks\">Fist Throaks</a>. Report to <a href=\"/wiki/Flymm_Cargo\" title=\"Flymm Cargo\">Flymm Cargo</a> on the first day of your shift. Complaints will not be tolerated.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Black Gauntlet Holzt\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195737\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1611/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27624/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6304/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936195/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.485      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   48.485      1 -total\n 62.33%   30.223      7 Template:Icon_text\n 50.58%   24.525     17 Template:Trim